{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An idle shop sim that lives in your taskbar.</strong> Run a tiny medieval store, <strong>hire workers</strong> to automate chores, plan their <strong>shifts and tasks</strong>, haggle with customers that show up based on the shop's ambience, craft &amp; upgrade items, and recruit those same customers as <strong>adventurers</strong> to bring back resources - all while you do other things.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize shelves, <strong>haggle</strong>, and hire assistants. Assign tasks, set <strong>schedules</strong>, and create simple automation rules so the shop runs smoothly even when you\u2019re away. <strong>Level up</strong> to learn new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/58742bee6e132cc9a83dd33bd15d181c.poster.avif?t=1770992621\" width=1170 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/58742bee6e132cc9a83dd33bd15d181c.webm?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/58742bee6e132cc9a83dd33bd15d181c.mp4?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate to Attract Buyers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own item shop, customizing its decorations to attract a variety of customers - each with their own tastes, budgets, and personalities.\u00a0Tune the vibe to shape your market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/808766de4332b77627fed317c0797b75.poster.avif?t=1770992621\" width=1170 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/808766de4332b77627fed317c0797b75.webm?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/808766de4332b77627fed317c0797b75.mp4?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft &amp; Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn materials  into <strong>recipes</strong> that scale in value. Discover blueprints, improve quality tiers, and <strong>forge gear for workers and adventurers</strong> to speed tasks and survive tougher routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/8ba9882a1dd5c3960b6485e4d85eb116.poster.avif?t=1770992621\" width=1170 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/8ba9882a1dd5c3960b6485e4d85eb116.webm?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/8ba9882a1dd5c3960b6485e4d85eb116.mp4?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire Adventurers &amp; Send Them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your favorite customers, gear them up, pick a <strong>path on a map</strong>, and send expeditions with different durations, risks, and rewards. Bring back materials, plans, and rares to sell for profit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade the City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the people\u2019s hearts and <strong>revive the town</strong> to dethrone the lazy king. City upgrades grant powerful buffs and new systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background-friendly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to sit on your desktop: a <strong>relaxing, cozy</strong> shop you control from the bottom of the screen. Pop in to tweak tasks, collect sales, claim loot, then get back to your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/f1efe70365e099c2ca9e3fad24d7c462.poster.avif?t=1770992621\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/f1efe70365e099c2ca9e3fad24d7c462.webm?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/f1efe70365e099c2ca9e3fad24d7c462.mp4?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>More Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle <strong>shop game built for the taskbar</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer spawns <strong>driven by your decoration</strong> choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic pricing &amp; haggling</strong> to maximize profit without scaring buyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; merchant skill progression</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>70+ recruitable customers</strong> as adventurers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire shop assistants</strong> and manage their shifts to organize your shop and maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable automations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/5b9174d6d79e1e7b20f0211594e3e466.poster.avif?t=1770992621\" width=1170 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/5b9174d6d79e1e7b20f0211594e3e466.webm?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/extras/5b9174d6d79e1e7b20f0211594e3e466.mp4?t=1770992621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868550?t=1770992621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/58f142b93bfb735f059acf9af179051229814ca6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770992621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/211b5adb9a6de3c409155dcbfbf5bcbb40a1dc00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770992621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868550/211b5adb9a6de3c409155dcbfbf5bcbb40a1dc00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770992621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An idle shop sim that lives in your taskbar.</strong> Run a tiny medieval store, <strong>hire workers</strong> to automate chores, plan their <strong>shifts and tasks</strong>, haggle with customers that show up based on the shop's ambience, craft &amp; upgrade items, and recruit those same customers as <strong>adventurers</strong> to bring back resources - all while you do other things.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize shelves, <strong>haggle</strong>, and hire assistants. Assign tasks, set <strong>schedules</strong>, and create simple automation rules so the shop runs smoothly even when you\u